 "na_101_02_6016_note": "TX-KEYS, 25 Sept 2026: NL-HaNA 1.01.02 inv. 6016 (public domain, METS at https://service.archief.nl/gaf/api/mets/v1/4153f78f-3369-4801-93bc-c3eb9b39012c, 624 pages) is UNINDEXED beyond year-folder dividers; only 6 of 624 pages sampled this pass (image order 1, 100, 180, 260, 261, 262). The 1605-1606 folder starts at image order 260/261 and has not been read further. A future capture worker should read image order ~261 through the next year divider (not yet located) for (a) any copy of the 21 Feb 1605 letter itself, (b) any nearby cipher passage with a gloss or key. Order-to-URL mapping method: fetch the METS XML, extract each structMap <div ORDER=\"N\" LABEL=\"...\"><fptr FILEID=\"IDxxxxxxxxDEF\"/> -- the file is at https://service.archief.nl/api/file/v1/default/<uuid> (strip the 'ID' prefix and 'DEF' suffix from FILEID to get <uuid>).",
